Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:37:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] fix(yocv): cred-002 uses the contract title, Solar PV
 Installation Basics

The persona's credential cred-002 was "Solar PV Basics: practical
challenge passed". The journey contract, SkillLens and the arriving card
say "Solar PV Installation Basics: practical challenge passed". The
end-to-end test showed both titles on one journey.

- server/card/personas.json: the contract title.
- tests/cv-record.test.cjs asserts the new title (failed first).
- scripts/export-handover.js uses it; handover prompts and cost
  estimate regenerated with npm run handover.
- README, demo script, Phase 4 slides, Talent Finder brief and mock-up
  use it. The spec records that the mismatch is fixed. The testing log
  keeps its earlier entry as run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
